  <item>
    <title>将热爱变成事业，是我与自己的和解：对话铁磁综训馆尚岩</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a5332a31e32575f5eb50f50</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5332a31e32575f5eb50f50</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2026 06:26:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>带会员上上课，没人时自己训练，甚至躺在椅子上刷手机——这可能是大部分人眼中铁馆主理人的日常。和任何一种创业一样，没有经历过深夜的EMO，人生不完整。</span></p><p><span>今天的嘉宾是【铁磁综合训练馆】的馆主 尚岩。我们一起聊聊，将热爱变成事业这件事，以及开综训馆背后的酸甜苦辣。</span></p><p><span>尚岩的社交媒体：</span></p><p><span>视频号：铁磁的尚岩</span><br><span>小红书：铁磁_尚岩</span><br><span>抖音：铁磁_尚岩</span></p><p><span>铁磁综训馆地址：北京市海淀区丰豪东路9号院10号楼B1下沉广场。</span></p><p><span>【时间线】【文末附6月青岛全力游戏照片】</span></p><p><strong><span>Part1 健身这回事</span></strong></p><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a> CF的社群文化：有点团建那味儿了</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="649">10:49</a> 运动习惯：开始比完美更重要</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="917">15:17</a> CF的心流体验：当你关注当下，不知不觉中艰难的训练计划就完成了</span><br></p><p><strong><span>Part2 开馆这回事</span></strong></p><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">25:58</a> 从健身爱好者到场馆经营者</span><br><br><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2153">35:53</a> 用户与成本控制</span><br><br><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2433">40:33</a> 活动组织与策划</span><br><br><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3269">54:29</a> 运营与盈利模式</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3592">59:52</a> 别人觉得我很爽，背后的苦只有我自己清楚</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4039">01:07:19</a> 经历焦虑，最终与自己和解</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4577">01:16:17</a> 别一时冲动来创业，也不会再回归打工人</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTPO9NCM5ZNwFPq1QUO-lL7BYgk.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0sk5avJRDJ4Rl36vYwMKUUx0h1.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlyKXOXpNlp0D-2Cj-sslKGOx_q6.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nrWmPj9NW_IFxY3xl_khdK9giFTE.jpg"><p><br></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6643fd629c296a7dd3eedd83/lj6K9dj60QoBB4JaqhmkQpJ8nose.m4a" length="68953005" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoRDOW6t5BxvXnageZ6Ua1FRWvyZ.png"/>
