    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 桥水作为全球最大的对冲基金如何穿越牛熊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a> 桥水创始人达利欧的成长历程，他如何赚取了自己的第一桶金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a> 大宗商品交易与达利欧的职业选择，没有选择热门的股票交易，达利欧反而获益</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a> 达利欧的牛刀小试，帮麦当劳解决麦乐鸡的定价问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 错误的预测导致财富归零，世界银行的投资帮助他帮助起死回生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1054">17:34</a> 纯粹阿尔法：分散投资以降低风险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1238">20:38</a> 全天候投资策略解析：适应经济周期的资产配置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1634">27:14</a> 风险平价投资的实践</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1758">29:18</a> 企业文化：极致透明与数据化治理，还有些双标？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 提前预警2008年金融危机，2020年疫情的U形翻转</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2766">46:06</a> 桥水全天候策略：分散投资新视角与实践</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考观看：</span><a href="https://www.bridgewater.cn/philosophy/economic-machine/" data-url="https://www.bridgewater.cn/philosophy/economic-machine/"><span>经济机器是怎样运行的 by Ray Dalio</span></a></p>]]></description>
